    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the squire to a band of lovely traveling adventurers! In this physics-based backpack puzzle game, your party members will request their possessions from you. It's your job to keep your backpack tidy and give them whatever they need. Oh, and also to manage the enchantments that keep befalling upon their stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure nothing spills out of your pack, and fulfill requests of your party members in a timely manner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck on your journey to become an expert packer! </p>",
